Hi {!Case.Contact},

Thanks for reaching out to EverQuote. We are not able to turn off the automatic billing function on the platform, since it's designed to charge the card on file when the account balance falls below $26. However, we do include a few features designed to help you maintain financial control of your account. We send an email when your account balance falls below $50, and we give you the 'Pause' function on the Dashboard - which gives you the ability to pause the campaign whenever you want. When paused, you will not receive any leads or incur any credit card charges.

Our advice would be to keep an eye out for the Low Balance email, and to pause the account when close to $25 if you're looking to prevent or delay further charges to the credit card on file.

If you have any questions or concerns going forward, feel free to reach out at (844) 707-8800 (Option 1).

Thanks,